<title>JAPAN: Japan 4-yr note auction lowest price 100.11.</title>
<headline>Japan 4-yr note auction lowest price 100.11.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said its auction of 500 billion yen in four-year government notes on Tuesday produced the following results:</p>
<p> Lowest price	 100.11    Stop rate	   1.670 pct</p>
<p> Average price	100.14    Average yield     1.662 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   1.5162 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted Bids	498.6 billion yen</p>
<p> Bid to cover ratio 3.04 times</p>
<p> Bids accepted at lowest price 16.3664 pct</p>
<p> Issue date    Oct 21, 1996   Maturity    Oct 20, 2000</p>
</text>
